/-! ## §2 — the arc-C-native CP-weight product `mixProd = G₁₂·G₂₃·H₁₃`. -/

/-- ★ THE ARC-C-NATIVE CP-WEIGHT PRODUCT `mixProd = G₁₂·G₂₃·H₁₃` — the Jarlskog amplitude content
